  "description": "After nearly drowning, Korean high school student Jinju has been able to see strange \"fish.\" Other than that her life continues as normal. That is, until one day after a snack on the way home from school, the \"fish\" become dangerous, and she's saved by two mysterious men who call themselves \"goblins.\" This story is a goblin fantasy that unfolds Jinju’s hidden, locked memories.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Best Challenge](https://comic.naver.com/bestChallenge/list.nhn?titleId=720924), [Kakao Webtoon League](https://webtoonleague.kakao.com/league/view/19281)",
